menu "KD Pixel Driver"

    config KD_PIXDRIVER_HTTP_API
        bool "Register the built-in /api/led HTTP handlers"
        default n
        help
            Compile and register kd_pixdriver's own REST handlers
            (/api/led/effects, /api/led/config, /api/led/channel/*) when the
            app calls PixelDriver::attach_api(). Apps that expose their own
            LED API (Tranquil's main/api/led_api.cpp) leave this off; the
            handlers and their cJSON dependency are then compiled out and
            attach_api() is a logging no-op.

endmenu
